#   Important Variables
#       WIFI_MAC_ADDRESS            - Holds MAC address
#
#   Important Constants
#       WIFI_POWER_OFF              - WIFI power off
#       WIFI_POWER_ON               - WIFI power on
#       WIFI_POWER_OFF_TIMEOUT      - Max time to wait for WIFI power off
#       WIFI_POWER_ON_TIMEOUT       - Max time to wait for WIFI power on 
#       WIFI_INFO_READY_TIMEOUT     - Max wait time for WIFI info
#
#   Routines
#       wifi_verify_chip_alive(void)- Verify the wifi responds as expected
#       wifi_hal_init(void)         - Hal initialization routine
#       wifi_hal_exit(void)         - Hal teardown routine
